- [ ] Create ECS cluster or EKS cluster
- [ ] Configure Application Load Balancer with target groups
- [ ] Set up CloudWatch log groups and metric filters
- [ ] Create Secrets Manager secrets for database credentials
- [ ] Configure IAM roles for ECS tasks or EKS pods
- [ ] Deploy X-Ray daemon as sidecar or DaemonSet
- [ ] Set up CloudWatch alarms for monitoring
- [ ] Configure auto-scaling policies
- [ ] Test deployment with rolling update strategy

**The application is well-architected for AWS deployment and requires only moderate effort to achieve production readiness.**